  ones the designer exported, unscaled and unretraced.

  That framing happens to be exactly right for an adaptive icon: the mark spans
  ~50% of the 1024 canvas, and the launcher's guaranteed-visible safe zone is
  the central 66 of 108dp — 61%. So it sits inside the safe area on every
  launcher mask (circle, squircle, rounded square) without any repositioning.
-->
